# Reco AI: raw hardware profile as JSON.
# Regenerate: vhs docs/vhs/reco-hw.tape

Output docs/assets/demo-reco-hw.gif
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 980
Set Height 560
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 50ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 0.95

Sleep 400ms
Type "reco hw --json"
Sleep 250ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
